      en: ["The Sittang River is 420 km long.", "Taungoo city has a population of 100,000.", "Annual rainfall is 1,200 mm.", "The valley produces 40% of Myanmar's sesame.", "The valley extends for about 150 km.", "The Sittang empties into the Gulf of Martaban."],
